WEBVTT

00:07:28.708 --> 00:07:30.851
By October 2019,

00:07:30.875 --> 00:07:34.934
the campaign had generated
more than 10 million videos

00:07:34.958 --> 00:07:37.875
and garnered 48 billion views.

00:07:38.667 --> 00:07:40.226
Through helping people learn

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:43.809
and participate in the process
of content creation,

00:07:43.833 --> 00:07:49.101
short videos are in fact helping prep
and train the skilled population

00:07:49.125 --> 00:07:52.393
that can take on
the challenges of the future.

00:07:52.417 --> 00:07:54.434
Like all social media,

00:07:54.458 --> 00:07:58.143
there are valid concerns
around short-video platforms,

00:07:58.167 --> 00:08:00.226
including data privacy,